<section class="sl alt pg" data-p="home"><div class="slw"><div class="split">
<aside class="vcard"><span class="eyebrow">Our promise</span><p class="hi" lang="hi">एक कदम समृद्धि की ओर</p><p class="vq">To be the most trusted and ethical source of our products across the globe.</p><ul class="vl"><li>Customer satisfaction is our 1st priority</li><li>Never compromise with quality standards</li><li>Always strive for better quality</li><li>Building long-term professional relations</li></ul><div class="seal"><b></b><span>certified company</span></div></aside>
<div><h2>Why choose us</h2><p class="intro">Customer satisfaction is our first priority. We never compromise on quality and always strive to deliver better solutions for growers.</p>
<div class="feat">
<div><i class="dot"></i><h3>Quality Focused</h3><p>We never compromise on quality standards.</p></div>
<div><i class="dot"></i><h3>Customer Satisfaction</h3><p>Customer satisfaction is our first priority.</p></div>
<div><i class="dot"></i><h3>Innovative Solutions</h3><p>We keep innovating to meet the needs of growers.</p></div>
<div><i class="dot"></i><h3>Professional Commitment</h3><p>We work within deadlines and take responsibility for our actions.</p></div>
<div><i class="dot"></i><h3>Continuous Learning</h3><p>We keep building new capabilities and adopting new approaches.</p></div>
<div><i class="dot"></i><h3>Value Creation</h3><p>We recommend practical, creative solutions that improve results.</p></div>
</div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="sl pg" data-p="home"><div class="slw"><h2>Farming made easy</h2><p class="intro">Order in four simple steps.</p>
<ol class="steps">
<li><b>Browse products</b>Search or filter by category, crop or price.</li>
<li><b>Choose a pack size</b>Pick size and quantity, then add to cart.</li>
<li><b>Place your order</b>Pay by cash on delivery, UPI or card.</li>
<li><b>Get delivery</b>Track your order to your doorstep.</li>
</ol></div></section>

<section class="sl alt pg" data-p="home"><div class="slw"><h2>Season-wise crops</h2><p class="intro">Find out which crop suits the season and choose the right protection.</p>
<div class="seasons">
<div><h3>Kharif crops</h3><span class="when">June to October</span><p>Monsoon crops such as rice, maize, cotton and soybean. They need warm weather and plenty of water.</p></div>
<div><h3>Rabi crops</h3><span class="when">October to March</span><p>Winter crops such as wheat, barley, mustard and gram. Sown in winter and harvested in spring.</p></div>
<div><h3>Zaid crops</h3><span class="when">March to June</span><p>Summer crops such as watermelon, cucumber and bitter gourd, grown between Rabi and Kharif.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="sl pg" data-p="home"><div class="slw"><p class="eyebrow">Our range</p><h2>Complete crop care in one place</h2><p class="intro">Our product range, as listed in the Praveka brochure.</p>
<div class="rg"><div><b>22</b>Insecticides</div><div><b>10</b>Fungicides</div><div><b>12</b>Herbicides</div><div><b>8</b>PGRNutrition</div><div><b>13</b>Pramukh Fertilizers</div></div></div></section>

